      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://jacobpedd.github.io/daily-digest/images/adk-2-14.jpg" alt="Illustration generated for the Google ADK release story" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Google's Agent Development Kit release stabilizes its core and adds a Microsoft Teams runner.</b></p>
