      <title>SF got $7M to expand its innovation team. Lurie just fired most of it</title>
      <link>https://sfstandard.com/2026/11/07/lurie-fires-innovation-office-staff-bloomberg-grant/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://sfstandard.com/2026/11/07/lurie-fires-innovation-office-staff-bloomberg-grant/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 09:00:00 -0800</pubDate>
      <category>San Francisco</category>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.sfstandard.com/image/994911177489/image_rrs77rcrip4e7bl2t3mi279f7l/-S1200x630-FPNG" alt="SF Standard image for the innovation office story" style="max-width:100%"/></p>
<p><b>Six of 10 staffers were fired Friday with no severance. City Hall won't say whether it met the conditions on Bloomberg's largest-ever city innovation grant, including a $2.38M payment due Nov. 1.</b></p>
<blockquote>&ldquo;No positions have been eliminated.&rdquo; - <a href="https://sfstandard.com/2026/11/07/lurie-fires-innovation-office-staff-bloomberg-grant/">Mayor's office statement, which did not dispute that six of 10 staffers lost their jobs</a></blockquote>
<blockquote>&ldquo;With that technology becoming more capable than it was even a couple of years ago, the Mayor's Office of Innovation should be capable of tackling a wide range of challenges.&rdquo; - <a href="https://sfstandard.com/2026/11/07/lurie-fires-innovation-office-staff-bloomberg-grant/">Charles Lutvak, Lurie spokesperson</a></blockquote>
<p>Sources: <a href="https://sfstandard.com/2026/11/07/lurie-fires-innovation-office-staff-bloomberg-grant/">SF Standard</a></p>
<p>Feedback: <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%3A%20loved%20%22SF%20got%20%247M%20to%20expand%20its%20innovation%20tea...%22">Loved it</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%3A%20meh%20on%20%22SF%20got%20%247M%20to%20expand%20its%20innovation%20tea...%22">Meh</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=Digest%2011/7%3A%20less%20like%20%22SF%20got%20%247M%20to%20expand%20its%20innovation%20tea...%22">Less of this</a> &middot; <a href="sms:+16506139572?&amp;body=https%3A//sfstandard.com/2026/11/07/lurie-fires-innovation-office-staff-bloomberg-grant/%0A">Chat about it</a></p>]]></description>
